  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release with dependency injection registration, queued workflow execution through a built-in background worker, in-memory persistence, run and step queries, execution logs, versioned workflow restoration, and retry while preserving successful work. Includes asynchronous, process-local lifecycle notifications for queued, started, completed, failed, and retried runs through application-defined scoped handlers. Notifications are published after successful persistence and support both the built-in processor and Hangfire. Delivery is best-effort, without durable storage or automatic handler retries. Includes invocation-scoped pipeline context injection, initialized before step construction using persisted run metadata.",
